{{Bagua|qq=}}
'''Xun''' (巽) is one of the {{ill|Bagua|ja|八卦|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Bagua|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Bagua|qq=}}. Its trigram form is {{resize|125%|'''☴'''|qq=}} with the first {{ill|Yao (lines)|ja|爻|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Yao (lines)|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Yao (lines)|qq=}} being Yin (⚋) and the second and third Yao being Yang (⚊). It is also one of the {{ill|Sixty-Four Hexagrams|ja|六十四卦|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Sixty-Four Hexagrams|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Sixty-Four Hexagrams|qq=}}, known as {{ill|Xun (Bagua)|ja|巽|1=Xun (Bagua)|2=ja|3=巽|lt=Xun (巽)|lt=巽為風|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Xun (Bagua)|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Xun (Bagua)|13=User:Immanuelle/Xun (Bagua)|qq=}}, consisting of Xun below and Xun above.

== Trigram Symbolism ==
Xun symbolizes {{ill|wind|ja|風|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/wind|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/wind|qq=}} (also associated with {{ill|wood|ja|Wood (木)|1=Wood (wuxing)|1=Wood (wuxing)|lt=Wood (木)|2=uk|3=Дерево (елемент)|4=id|5=Kayu (Wu Xing)|6=ms|7=Kayu (Wu Xing)|8=bcl|9=Kahoy (wuxing)|10=ca|11=Fusta (wuxing)|12=it|13=Legno (elemento)|14=es|15=Madera (Wu Xing)|16=nl|17=Hout (element)|18=vi|19=Mộc (Ngũ hành)|20=tr|21=Tahta (klasik element)|22=ta|23=மரம் (சீன மெய்யியல்)|2=it|3=Legno (elemento)|4=es|5=Madera (Wu Xing)|6=tr|7=Tahta (klasik element)|1=Wood (wuxing)|lt=Wood (木)|lt=Wood (木)|2=uk|3=Дерево (елемент)|4=id|5=Kayu (Wu Xing)|6=ms|7=Kayu (Wu Xing)|8=bcl|9=Kahoy (wuxing)|10=ca|11=Fusta (wuxing)|12=it|13=Legno (elemento)|14=es|15=Madera (Wu Xing)|16=nl|17=Hout (element)|18=vi|19=Mộc (Ngũ hành)|20=tr|21=Tahta (klasik element)|22=ta|23=மரம் (சீன மெய்யியல்)|2=it|3=Legno (elemento)|4=es|5=Madera (Wu Xing)|6=tr|7=Tahta (klasik element)|1=Wood (wuxing)|1=Wood (wuxing)|lt=Wood (木)|2=uk|3=Дерево (елемент)|4=id|5=Kayu (Wu Xing)|6=ms|7=Kayu (Wu Xing)|8=bcl|9=Kahoy (wuxing)|10=ca|11=Fusta (wuxing)|12=it|13=Legno (elemento)|14=es|15=Madera (Wu Xing)|16=nl|17=Hout (element)|18=vi|19=Mộc (Ngũ hành)|20=tr|21=Tahta (klasik element)|22=ta|23=மரம் (சீன மெய்யியல்)|2=it|3=Legno (elemento)|4=es|5=Madera (Wu Xing)|6=tr|7=Tahta (klasik element)|1=Wood (wuxing)|lt=Wood (木)|lt=Wood (木)|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/wood|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/wood|13=User:Immanuelle/Wood (wuxing)|1=Wood (wuxing)|lt=Wood (木)|2=uk|3=Дерево (елемент)|4=id|5=Kayu (Wu Xing)|6=ms|7=Kayu (Wu Xing)|8=bcl|9=Kahoy (wuxing)|10=ca|11=Fusta (wuxing)|12=it|13=Legno (elemento)|14=es|15=Madera (Wu Xing)|16=nl|17=Hout (element)|18=vi|19=Mộc (Ngũ hành)|20=tr|21=Tahta (klasik element)|22=ta|23=மரம் (சீன மெய்யியல்)|2=it|3=Legno (elemento)|4=es|5=Madera (Wu Xing)|6=tr|7=Tahta (klasik element)|1=Wood (wuxing)|lt=Wood (木)|qq=}}), entry, {{ill|chickens|ja|ニワトリ|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/chickens|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/chickens|qq=}}, the thighs, the eldest daughter (a woman of {{ill|marriageable age|ja|結婚適齢期|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/marriageable age|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/marriageable age|qq=}}), {{ill|marriage proposals|ja|縁談|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/marriage proposals|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/marriage proposals|qq=}}, anything long, {{ill|blood vessels|ja|血管|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/blood vessels|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/blood vessels|qq=}}, {{ill|hair|ja|毛髪|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/hair|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/hair|qq=}}, {{ill|small intestine|ja|小腸|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/small intestine|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/small intestine|qq=}}, {{ill|large intestine|ja|大腸|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/large intestine|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/large intestine|qq=}}, {{ill|bronchi|ja|気管支|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/bronchi|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/bronchi|qq=}}, submersion, and the {{ill|respiratory system|ja|呼吸器|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/respiratory system|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/respiratory system|qq=}}. As a {{ill|cardinal direction|ja|方位|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/cardinal direction|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/cardinal direction|qq=}}, it represents the {{ill|southeast|ja|東南|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/southeast|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/southeast|qq=}}, specifically the area between {{ill|Chen (Earthly Branch)|ja|辰|1=Dragon (Zodiac)|lt=Dragon (辰)|2=ja|3=辰|1=Dragon (zodiac)|lt=Dragon (辰)|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Chen (Earthly Branch)|13=User:Immanuelle/Dragon (zodiac)|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Chen (Earthly Branch)|13=User:Immanuelle/Dragon (Zodiac)|qq=}} and {{ill|Si (Earthly Branch)|ja|巳|1=Snake (Zodiac)|lt=Snake (巳)|2=ja|3=巳|1=Snake (zodiac)|lt=Snake (巳)|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Si (Earthly Branch)|13=User:Immanuelle/Snake (zodiac)|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Si (Earthly Branch)|13=User:Immanuelle/Snake (Zodiac)|qq=}}.

In the {{ill|Na Jia|ja|納甲|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Na Jia|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Na Jia|qq=}} system, Xun is associated with {{ill|Xin (Heavenly Stem)|ja|辛|1=Kanoto (辛)|lt=Kanoto (辛)|2=ja|3=辛|4=zh|5=辛|1=Kanoto (辛)|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Xin (Heavenly Stem)|13=User:Immanuelle/Kanoto (辛)|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Xin (Heavenly Stem)|13=User:Immanuelle/Kanoto (辛)|qq=}}, the Metal element in {{ill|Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|lt=Wuxing|ja|五行思想|1=Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|2=ja|3=五行思想|lt=Five Elements (Wuxing)|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|13=User:Immanuelle/Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|13=User:Immanuelle/Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|qq=}}, and the {{ill|west|ja|西|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/west|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/west|qq=}} among the {{ill|Five Directions|ja|五方|lt=Five Directions|1=Cardinal direction|2=ja|3=方位|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Five Directions|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Five Directions|13=User:Immanuelle/Cardinal direction|qq=}}.

== Direction ==
As a {{ill|cardinal direction|ja|方位|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/cardinal direction|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/cardinal direction|qq=}}, Xun corresponds to the {{ill|southeast|ja|東南|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/southeast|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/southeast|qq=}}. When the four cardinal directions (east, west, south, north) are divided into twelve parts using the {{ill|Earthly Branches|ja|十二支|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Earthly Branches|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Earthly Branches|qq=}}, intermediate directions such as northeast, southeast, southwest, and northwest cannot be fully expressed. To address this, the eight trigrams—{{ill|Kan|ja|坎|1=Kan (Bagua)|2=ja|3=坎|lt=Kan (坎)|1=Kan (Bagua)|lt=Kan|lt=Kan (☵)|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kan|13=User:Immanuelle/Kan (Bagua)|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kan|13=User:Immanuelle/Kan (Bagua)|qq=}}, {{ill|Gen|ja|艮|1=Gen (Bagua)|2=ja|3=艮|lt=Gen (艮)|1=Gen (Bagua)|lt=Gen|lt=Gen (☶)|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Gen|13=User:Immanuelle/Gen (Bagua)|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Gen|13=User:Immanuelle/Gen (Bagua)|qq=}}, {{ill|Zhen|ja|震|1=Zhen (Bagua)|2=ja|3=震|lt=Zhen (震)|1=Zhen (Bagua)|lt=Zhen|lt=Zhen (☳)|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Zhen|13=User:Immanuelle/Zhen (Bagua)|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Zhen|13=User:Immanuelle/Zhen (Bagua)|qq=}}, {{ill|Xun|ja|巽|1=Xun (Bagua)|2=ja|3=巽|lt=Xun (巽)|1=Xun (Bagua)|lt=Xun|lt=Xun (☴)|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Xun|13=User:Immanuelle/Xun (Bagua)|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Xun|13=User:Immanuelle/Xun (Bagua)|qq=}}, {{ill|Li|ja|離|1=Li (Bagua)|2=ja|3=離|lt=Li (離)|1=Li (Bagua)|lt=Li|lt=Li (☲)|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Li|13=User:Immanuelle/Li (Bagua)|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Li|13=User:Immanuelle/Li (Bagua)|qq=}}, {{ill|Kun|ja|坤|1=Kun (Bagua)|2=ja|3=坤|lt=Kun (坤)|1=Kun (Bagua)|lt=Kun|lt=Kun (☷)|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kun|13=User:Immanuelle/Kun (Bagua)|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kun|13=User:Immanuelle/Kun (Bagua)|qq=}}, {{ill|Dui|ja|兌|1=Dui (Bagua)|2=ja|3=兌|4=zh-yue|5=兌卦|6=ko|7=태 (괘)|8=fr|9=Duì|10=nl|11=Meer (trigram)|12=pt|13=Duì (I Ching)|14=zh-min-nan|15=Tōe-kòa|lt=Dui (兌)|1=Dui (Bagua)|2=ja|3=兌|4=zh-yue|5=兌卦|6=ko|7=태 (괘)|8=fr|9=Duì|10=nl|11=Meer (trigram)|12=pt|13=Duì (I Ching)|14=zh-min-nan|15=Tōe-kòa|lt=Dui (兌)|1=Dui (Bagua)|lt=Dui|lt\=Dui (☱)|lt=Dui (☱)|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Dui|13=User:Immanuelle/Dui (Bagua)|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Dui|13=User:Immanuelle/Dui (Bagua)|qq=}}, and {{ill|Qian|ja|乾|1=Qian (Bagua)|2=ja|3=乾|lt=Qian (乾)|1=Qian (Bagua)|lt=Qian|lt=Qian (☰)|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Qian|13=User:Immanuelle/Qian (Bagua)|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Qian|13=User:Immanuelle/Qian (Bagua)|qq=}}—are used to indicate directions<ref>「[https://www.ndl.go.jp/koyomi/chapter3/s2.html 干支2方位神]」National Diet Library, accessed December 16, 2021.</ref>. Because it lies between {{ill|Chen (辰)|ja|辰|1=Dragon (Zodiac)|lt=Dragon (辰)|2=ja|3=辰|1=Dragon (zodiac)|lt=Dragon (辰)|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Chen (辰)|13=User:Immanuelle/Dragon (zodiac)|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Chen (辰)|13=User:Immanuelle/Dragon (Zodiac)|qq=}} (*tatsu*) and {{ill|Si (巳)|ja|巳|1=Snake (Zodiac)|lt=Snake (巳)|2=ja|3=巳|1=Snake (zodiac)|lt=Snake (巳)|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Si (巳)|13=User:Immanuelle/Snake (zodiac)|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Si (巳)|13=User:Immanuelle/Snake (Zodiac)|qq=}} (*mi*), Xun is also read as *Tatsumi* (たつみ).

== Earlier Heaven Arrangement ==
In the {{ill|Fuxi Earlier Heaven Bagua|ja|伏羲先天八卦|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Fuxi Earlier Heaven Bagua|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Fuxi Earlier Heaven Bagua|qq=}}, Xun is the fifth in sequence and is positioned as one of the four corner trigrams, representing {{ill|southwest|ja|西南|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/southwest|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/southwest|qq=}}. In terms of Yin-Yang transformation, it represents the emergence of one Yin.

