{{Bagua|qq=}}
'''Xun''' (巽) is one of the {{ill|Bagua|en|Bagua|WD=Q340846|lt=Bagua|1=Bagua}}. Its trigram form is {{resize|125%|'''☴'''|qq=}} with the first {{ill|Yao (lines)|ja|爻|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Yao (lines)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Yao (lines)|qq=}} being Yin (⚋) and the second and third Yao being Yang (⚊). It is also one of the {{ill|Hexagram (I Ching)|en|Hexagram (I Ching)|WD=Q1572403|lt=Sixty-Four Hexagrams|1=Hexagram (I Ching)}}, known as {{ill|Xun (Bagua)|ja|巽|1=Xùn (Bagua)|2=ja|3=巽|lt=Xun (巽)|lt=巽為風|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Xun (Bagua)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Xun (Bagua)|13=User:Immanuelle/Xun (Bagua)|comment=changed title based on wikidata|WD=Q2544836}}, consisting of Xun below and Xun above.

== Trigram Symbolism ==
Xun symbolizes {{ill|Wind|en|Wind|WD=Q8094|lt=wind|1=Wind}} (also associated with {{ill|wood|ja|Wood (木)|1=Wood (wuxing)|1=Wood (wuxing)|lt=Wood (木)|2=uk|3=Дерево (елемент)|4=id|5=Kayu (Wu Xing)|6=ms|7=Kayu (Wu Xing)|8=bcl|9=Kahoy (wuxing)|10=ca|11=Fusta (wuxing)|12=it|13=Legno (elemento)|14=es|15=Madera (Wu Xing)|16=nl|17=Hout (element)|18=vi|19=Mộc (Ngũ hành)|20=tr|21=Tahta (klasik element)|22=ta|23=மரம் (சீன மெய்யியல்)|2=it|3=Legno (elemento)|4=es|5=Madera (Wu Xing)|6=tr|7=Tahta (klasik element)|1=Wood (wuxing)|lt=Wood (木)|lt=Wood (木)|2=uk|3=Дерево (елемент)|4=id|5=Kayu (Wu Xing)|6=ms|7=Kayu (Wu Xing)|8=bcl|9=Kahoy (wuxing)|10=ca|11=Fusta (wuxing)|12=it|13=Legno (elemento)|14=es|15=Madera (Wu Xing)|16=nl|17=Hout (element)|18=vi|19=Mộc (Ngũ hành)|20=tr|21=Tahta (klasik element)|22=ta|23=மரம் (சீன மெய்யியல்)|2=it|3=Legno (elemento)|4=es|5=Madera (Wu Xing)|6=tr|7=Tahta (klasik element)|1=Wood (wuxing)|1=Wood (wuxing)|lt=Wood (木)|2=uk|3=Дерево (елемент)|4=id|5=Kayu (Wu Xing)|6=ms|7=Kayu (Wu Xing)|8=bcl|9=Kahoy (wuxing)|10=ca|11=Fusta (wuxing)|12=it|13=Legno (elemento)|14=es|15=Madera (Wu Xing)|16=nl|17=Hout (element)|18=vi|19=Mộc (Ngũ hành)|20=tr|21=Tahta (klasik element)|22=ta|23=மரம் (சீன மெய்யியல்)|2=it|3=Legno (elemento)|4=es|5=Madera (Wu Xing)|6=tr|7=Tahta (klasik element)|1=Wood (wuxing)|lt=Wood (木)|lt=Wood (木)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/wood|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/wood|13=User:Immanuelle/Wood (wuxing)|1=Wood (wuxing)|lt=Wood (木)|2=uk|3=Дерево (елемент)|4=id|5=Kayu (Wu Xing)|6=ms|7=Kayu (Wu Xing)|8=bcl|9=Kahoy (wuxing)|10=ca|11=Fusta (wuxing)|12=it|13=Legno (elemento)|14=es|15=Madera (Wu Xing)|16=nl|17=Hout (element)|18=vi|19=Mộc (Ngũ hành)|20=tr|21=Tahta (klasik element)|22=ta|23=மரம் (சீன மெய்யியல்)|2=it|3=Legno (elemento)|4=es|5=Madera (Wu Xing)|6=tr|7=Tahta (klasik element)|1=Wood (wuxing)|lt=Wood (木)|ja_comment=jawiki link invalid}}), entry, {{ill|Chicken|en|Chicken|WD=Q780|lt=chickens|1=Chicken}}, the thighs, the eldest daughter (a woman of {{ill|marriageable age|ja|結婚適齢期|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/marriageable age|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/marriageable age|qq=}}), {{ill|marriage proposals|ja|縁談|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/marriage proposals|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/marriage proposals|1=Q97312246|comment=changed title based on wikidata|WD=Q97312246}}, anything long, {{ill|Blood vessel|en|Blood vessel|WD=Q988343|lt=blood vessels|1=Blood vessel}}, {{ill|hair|ja|毛髪|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/hair|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/hair|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to 頭髪|1=Head hair|comment=changed title based on wikidata|WD=Q336128}}, {{ill|Small intestine|en|Small intestine|WD=Q11090|lt=small intestine|1=Small intestine}}, {{ill|Large intestine|en|Large intestine|WD=Q11083|lt=large intestine|1=Large intestine}}, {{ill|Bronchus|en|Bronchus|WD=Q181602|lt=bronchi|1=Bronchus}}, submersion, and the {{ill|Respiratory system|en|Respiratory system|WD=Q7891|lt=respiratory system|1=Respiratory system}}. As a {{ill|Cardinal direction|en|Cardinal direction|WD=Q23718|lt=Five directions|1=Cardinal direction}}, it represents the {{ill|southeast|ja|東南|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/southeast|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/southeast|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to 南東|1=Southeast|comment=changed title based on wikidata|WD=Q6452640}}, specifically the area between {{ill|Chen (Earthly Branch)|ja|辰|1=chén|lt=Dragon (辰)|2=ja|3=辰|1=Dragon (zodiac)|lt=Dragon (辰)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Chen (Earthly Branch)|13=User:Immanuelle/Dragon (zodiac)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Chen (Earthly Branch)|13=User:Immanuelle/Dragon (Zodiac)|comment=changed title based on wikidata|WD=Q16538966}} and {{ill|Si (Earthly Branch)|ja|巳|1=Snake (Zodiac)|lt=Snake (巳)|2=ja|3=巳|1=Snake (zodiac)|lt=Snake (巳)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Si (Earthly Branch)|13=User:Immanuelle/Snake (zodiac)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Si (Earthly Branch)|13=User:Immanuelle/Snake (Zodiac)|qq=}}.

In the {{ill|Na Jia|ja|納甲|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Na Jia|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Na Jia|qq=}} system, Xun is associated with {{ill|Xin (Heavenly Stem)|ja|辛|1=Kanoto (辛)|lt=Kanoto (辛)|2=ja|3=辛|4=zh|5=辛|1=Kanoto (辛)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Xin (Heavenly Stem)|13=User:Immanuelle/Kanoto (辛)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Xin (Heavenly Stem)|13=User:Immanuelle/Kanoto (辛)|qq=}}, the Metal element in {{ill|Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|en|Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|WD=Q218652|lt=Five Elements (Wuxing)|1=Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)}}, and the {{ill|West|en|West|WD=Q679|lt=west|1=West}} among the {{ill|Cardinal direction|en|Cardinal direction|WD=Q23718|lt=Five Directions|1=Cardinal direction}}.

== Direction ==
As a {{ill|Cardinal direction|en|Cardinal direction|WD=Q23718|lt=Five directions|1=Cardinal direction}}, Xun corresponds to the {{ill|southeast|ja|東南|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/southeast|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/southeast|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to 南東|1=Southeast|comment=changed title based on wikidata|WD=Q6452640}}. When the four cardinal directions (east, west, south, north) are divided into twelve parts using the {{ill|Earthly Branches|en|Earthly Branches|WD=Q1072961|lt=Earthly Branches|1=Earthly Branches}}, intermediate directions such as northeast, southeast, southwest, and northwest cannot be fully expressed. To address this, the eight trigrams—{{ill|Kan|ja|坎|1=Kǎn (Bagua)|2=ja|3=坎|lt=Kǎn (坎)|1=Kǎn (Bagua)|lt=Kan|lt=Kan (☵)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kan|13=User:Immanuelle/Kǎn (Bagua)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kan|13=User:Immanuelle/Kǎn (Bagua)|qq=}}, {{ill|Gen|ja|艮|1=Gèn (Bagua)|2=ja|3=艮|lt=Gen (艮)|1=Gèn (Bagua)|lt=Gen|lt=Gen (☶)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Gen|13=User:Immanuelle/Gèn (Bagua)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Gen|13=User:Immanuelle/Gèn (Bagua)|qq=}}, {{ill|Zhen|ja|震|1=Zhèn (Bagua)|2=ja|3=震|lt=Zhèn (震)|1=Zhèn (Bagua)|lt=Zhen|lt=Zhen (☳)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Zhen|13=User:Immanuelle/Zhèn (Bagua)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Zhen|13=User:Immanuelle/Zhèn (Bagua)|qq=}}, {{ill|Xun|ja|巽|1=Xùn (Bagua)|2=ja|3=巽|lt=Xun (巽)|1=Xun (Bagua)|lt=Xun|lt=Xun (☴)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Xun|13=User:Immanuelle/Xun (Bagua)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Xun|13=User:Immanuelle/Xun (Bagua)|comment=changed title based on wikidata|WD=Q2544836}}, {{ill|Li|ja|離|1=Lí (Bagua)|2=ja|3=離|lt=Li (離)|1=Lí (Bagua)|lt=Li|lt=Li (☲)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Li|13=User:Immanuelle/Lí (Bagua)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Li|13=User:Immanuelle/Lí (Bagua)|qq=}}, {{ill|Kun|ja|坤|1=Kūn (Bagua)|2=ja|3=坤|lt=Kūn (坤)|1=Kūn (Bagua)|lt=Kun|lt=Kun (☷)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kun|13=User:Immanuelle/Kūn (Bagua)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kun|13=User:Immanuelle/Kūn (Bagua)|qq=}}, {{ill|Dui|ja|兌|1=Duì (Bagua)|2=ja|3=兌|4=zh-yue|5=兌卦|6=ko|7=태 (괘)|8=fr|9=Duì|10=nl|11=Meer (trigram)|12=pt|13=Duì (I Ching)|14=zh-min-nan|15=Tōe-kòa|lt=Dui (兌)|1=Duì (Bagua)|2=ja|3=兌|4=zh-yue|5=兌卦|6=ko|7=태 (괘)|8=fr|9=Duì|10=nl|11=Meer (trigram)|12=pt|13=Duì (I Ching)|14=zh-min-nan|15=Tōe-kòa|lt=Dui (兌)|1=Duì (Bagua)|lt=Dui|lt\=Dui (☱)|lt=Dui (☱)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Dui|13=User:Immanuelle/Duì (Bagua)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Dui|13=User:Immanuelle/Duì (Bagua)|qq=}}, and {{ill|Qian|ja|乾|1=Qián (Bagua)|2=ja|3=乾|lt=Qian (乾)|1=Qián (Bagua)|lt=Qian|lt=Qian (☰)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Qian|13=User:Immanuelle/Qián (Bagua)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Qian|13=User:Immanuelle/Qián (Bagua)|qq=}}—are used to indicate directions<ref>「[https://www.ndl.go.jp/koyomi/chapter3/s2.html 干支2方位神]」National Diet Library, accessed December 16, 2021.</ref>. Because it lies between {{ill|Chen (辰)|ja|辰|1=chén|lt=Dragon (辰)|2=ja|3=辰|1=Dragon (zodiac)|lt=Dragon (辰)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Chen (辰)|13=User:Immanuelle/Dragon (zodiac)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Chen (辰)|13=User:Immanuelle/Dragon (Zodiac)|comment=changed title based on wikidata|WD=Q16538966}} (*tatsu*) and {{ill|Si (巳)|ja|巳|1=Snake (Zodiac)|lt=Snake (巳)|2=ja|3=巳|1=Snake (zodiac)|lt=Snake (巳)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Si (巳)|13=User:Immanuelle/Snake (zodiac)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Si (巳)|13=User:Immanuelle/Snake (Zodiac)|qq=}} (*mi*), Xun is also read as *Tatsumi* (たつみ).

== Earlier Heaven Arrangement ==
In the {{ill|Fuxi Earlier Heaven Bagua|ja|伏羲先天八卦|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Fuxi Earlier Heaven Bagua|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Fuxi Earlier Heaven Bagua|ja_comment=jawiki link invalid|WD=Q135491528|1=Fuxi Earlier Heaven Bagua}}, Xun is the fifth in sequence and is positioned as one of the four corner trigrams, representing {{ill|southwest|ja|西南|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/southwest|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/southwest|1=Q11627311|comment=changed title based on wikidata|WD=Q11627311}}. In terms of Yin-Yang transformation, it represents the emergence of one Yin.

